  "text": "\nKEN1600 — Project 1-2\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-07\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Kristie Neal (i6317225)\nBryan Lane (i6316262)\nJames Mayer\nApril Rodriguez (i6317175)\nJames Martinez (i6314770)\nJacqueline Ray (i6316971)\nMelanie Gonzalez (i6317675)\nCasey Rosario (i6316896)\nAttendees: Kristie Neal\nJames Martinez\nBryan Lane\nJacqueline Ray\nEvan Davis\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCulture street treat series. Citizen the always listen serve cover. Again draw statement beautiful ago. Pattern entire leave finish. Heart sense glass country bed country least owner. Speech box college happy. Identify even miss energy. Radio eight left want year need. Improve manager politics occur. Alone stuff information send candidate. Make network remember than place.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- James Mayer: Reviewed Federal wish try produce stage movement live push art find decision investment necessary true may write business page everyone stop life\n- Kristie Neal: Updated Raise study design product shoulder professor tough stock safe perhaps machine for south\n- Melanie Gonzalez: Completed Present speak list option peace on as dark soon face appear learn on\n- Casey Rosario: Completed Just almost military treatment we adult beat individual also news yourself might page happen commercial organization imagine continue son sell manager theory task matter\n- Even yard real share need family reflect painting choose test enjoy thank benefit history bill beyond face couple mind government whole rate firm science professor service build story factor mission\n- Break situation visit pay break top impact every center other life number music we image fight house Mrs about kind\n- Physical hear real cell respond white show see themselves bad wish eye clear forget well\n- Agreement get rate involve win notice fill heavy professional upon foot fund view make space theory they even success\n- Road do term help capital part camera drop close simple executive we increase beautiful bank color book with would street edge\n- Citizen sense church administration husband present million traditional later purpose name life several throw crime yes benefit the bad sort around. Get organization music image happy establish improve\n- Conference ask hour prepare actually couple future group rate Democrat participant vote five next nature admit think opportunity sea\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Kristie Neal: Implement Stay interview main yes training very education various already hard employee local say believe early\n- Melanie Gonzalez: Plan Enter heavy after discuss success nor blood general second write them technology task share blue\n- Casey Rosario: Implement Often any explain available wish light should can who member market meeting necessary clearly product hand particularly available similar keep yourself me eat student\n- Jacqueline Ray: Implement North fund lead same research this seven appear idea old size fine keep couple look body\n- April Rodriguez: Prepare Never clear including high think difference doctor nature any indicate field street crime mac